# The docker build context is ephemeral and assembled by scripts/stage-context.sh
# (binaries, fetched ydbinstall.sh, copies of m-stdlib/MSL). Every source in it is
# single-sourced in its owning repo — vendoring a copy here would create the
# second-implementation drift the staging script exists to avoid.
.build-context/

